cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: neuro-report
abstract: 'The last step of the systems neuroscience workflows (Neuropixels Spike Sorting, Two-photon Calcium Imaging,
  Markerless Behaviour, Neural Population Dynamics & Decoding, and the end-to-end IBL workflow): reads whatever
  step outputs are linked (each app''s summary.json and provenance.json) and writes one report a neuroscientist
  can read and share, as a self-contained offline HTML page, a PDF and report.json, with each step''s headline numbers,
  figures and captions, warnings, methods, software versions and the union of every step''s citations.'
